# Flok TypeScript

- Strict TypeScript. No `any` in shipped `src/` (generated `routeTree.gen.ts` excluded).
- Prefer existing patterns in neighboring files over new abstractions.
- Domain data access is raw SQL via `src/lib/db.ts` / `src/lib/queries.ts` — Kysely is for Better Auth only.
- Public UI copy: Node, Pulse, Cluster, Roost, Rack, Tape — not bird/chirp/Sky in new strings.
- Components stay focused; no drive-by refactors outside the task.
